<span class="line"><span>    积木: ⟨43⟩I + ⟨30422⟩ ate + ⟨260⟩ a + ⟨3734⟩ big + ⟨19900⟩ bowl + ⟨294⟩ of + ⟨68099⟩ noodles + ⟨362⟩ for + ⟨17980⟩ lunch + ⟨4316⟩ today + ⟨16⟩.</span></span>
